# Copy to local.env (gitignored) for keys of your own and overrides of dev.env;
# a variable set here wins. Restart `make dev` after a change.
# `go run ./cmd/web serve --help` lists every setting.

# Grammar checks and style reviews call the Claude API and are off without a
# key: no buttons, no panel, and their routes answer 404.
# PROOFREAD_ANTHROPIC_KEY=

# A real speech-to-text service instead of the WireMock stub.
# STT_OPENAI_COMPAT_ENDPOINT=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
# STT_OPENAI_COMPAT_KEY=
